---
const points = [
  {
    title: 'Evidence on every holding',
    body: 'Editorial bags cite the issuer product directory. Disclosure bags cite each STOCK Act filing that contributed, with a link to the House Clerk or Senate eFD record.',
    tone: 'bg-brand-soft text-brand',
    icon: 'M9 12h6m-6 4h6M7 4h7l5 5v11a1 1 0 01-1 1H7a1 1 0 01-1-1V5a1 1 0 011-1z',
  },
  {
    title: 'Curated, not generated',
    body: 'Stockpile Editorial hand-picks composition; Pelosi Tracker and Congress Consensus are computed from public periodic transaction reports. No member endorses a bag.',
    tone: 'bg-tertiary-soft text-tertiary',
    icon: 'M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z',
  },
  {
    title: 'Live market context',
    body: '24h change, on-chain liquidity, and the premium or discount of each token versus its underlying stock or issuer mark, via Jupiter. Shown in the app, never on this page.',
    tone: 'bg-mint-soft text-positive',
    icon: 'M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8M14 7h7v7',
  },
  {
    title: 'Your keys, your swaps',
    body: 'A Privy embedded Solana wallet signs each Jupiter swap after you inspect it on-device. Stockpile never custodies funds, never signs, never submits.',
    tone: 'bg-coral-soft text-[#C0392B]',
    icon: 'M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z',
  },
];
---

<section id="receipts" class="section">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Curated with receipts</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-text text-balance">No thesis without a source.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-text-subtle text-pretty">
          A bag is only as good as what backs it. Stockpile shows the filing, the directory entry, or the story behind every
          weight, and the lag, range, and liquidity caveats that come with it.
        </p>

        <!-- Illustrative disclosure receipt -->
        <div class="mt-8 card squircle p-5 max-w-md" aria-label="Example of a disclosure receipt">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-text-muted">
            <span class="badge badge-coral text-xs py-0.5">Disclosure</span>
            <span>House Clerk PTR</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 font-semibold text-text">Periodic transaction report</p>
          <dl class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-sm">
            <dt class="text-text-muted">Member</dt><dd class="text-text font-medium">Named on filing</dd>
            <dt class="text-text-muted">Type</dt><dd class="text-text font-medium">Purchase</dd>
            <dt class="text-text-muted">Amount</dt><dd class="text-text font-medium">Disclosed range</dd>
            <dt class="text-text-muted">Lag</dt><dd class="text-text font-medium">30–45 days</dd>
          </dl>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-text-muted">
            Ranges, not amounts. Filings include spouse trades. Not a live portfolio.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-5">
        {points.map((p) => (
          <li class="card squircle p-6">
            <span class:list={['w-11 h-11 rounded-xl squircle grid place-items-center', p.tone]}>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d={p.icon} /></svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl text-text">{p.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-subtle text-pretty">{p.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
